#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/mobile-app.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs desktop shell"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/mobile-app.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|                | Desktop Tauri                        | Android Tauri                       |\n"
"| -------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| Injection      | `bootstrap-tauri-desktop` → ShellApi | `bootstrap-tauri-mobile` → ShellApi |\n"
"| Habitat config | 设置 → 连接 → `~/.anima` prefs       | 设置 → 连接 → app config dir        |\n"
"| Companion      | overlay WebView                      | n/a（番茄钟小组件 MVP）             |\n"
"| REST / RPC     | Direct Habitat + Bearer / WS         | Same                                |\n"
msgstr ""
